{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119784","id":3748599618,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7fbxdC","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119784","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119784.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119784.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119784","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119784/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119784/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119784/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/14ef289eeed444601dfedca99333180d44ac831f","number":119784,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix flickering lighting on mesh-instances with non-uniform scale","user":{"login":"hepta-gon","id":288010141,"node_id":"U_kgDOESqvnQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/288010141?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hepta-gon","html_url":"https://github.com/hepta-gon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hepta-gon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hepta-gon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hepta-gon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hepta-gon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hepta-gon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hepta-gon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hepta-gon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hepta-gon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hepta-gon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #106150\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n- The flickering happens because sometimes the matrix for non-uniform scale is applied to the normals while othertimes it's the matrix for uniform scale. This is caused by a flickering `non_uniform_scale` flag which in turn is caused by floating point imprecisions.\r\n- The flickering occures when `min_scale / max_scale` is around the epsilon, which was 0.9 before the fix.\r\n- I tightend the epsilon to 0.999 which should still leave room for floating point inaccuracies. The flag will now alternate when `min_scale / max_scale` is around 0.999. However, at this point the matrices for uniform and non-uniform scale are similiar enough that no visual flicker should be apparent.\r\n- Note: This change will cause more geometry instances to be considered as non-uniformly scaled. This could have a minor impact on performance in scenes with many slightly non-uniformly scaled instances.\r\n\r\n\r\n_Bugsquad edit: Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101377_","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labe